# Local state that never belongs in a commit.
#
# `.claude/worktrees/` holds the linked worktrees Claude Code makes, and the three folders beside
# it those the worktree script makes for the other CLIs; ignoring them is what
# keeps each checkout's own `.git` from reading to the parent as a gitlink and being committed as a
# phantom submodule. `.worktree/` is the briefing and ports that the setup script writes into each
# worktree, and `.scratch/` a session's working files.
.claude/worktrees/
.codex/worktrees/
.copilot/worktrees/
.opencode/worktrees/
.worktree/
.scratch/
node_modules/
# bd's physical-workspace lock sits beside .beads rather than inside its ignored database.
*.gate.lock*
**/.DS_Store
